        "value": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;\">PROPOSAL</span></p><h1>[Project name]</h1><p>For <strong>[Client]</strong> · From <strong>[Your company]</strong> · [Month day, year]</p><h2>Overview</h2><p>[Two or three sentences: what you propose to do, for whom, and the result they get.]</p><h2>The need</h2><p>[The client's situation and the problem or opportunity, in their words.]</p><h2>Our approach</h2><ol><li><strong>[Phase]</strong> — [what happens and what the client sees at the end].</li><li><strong>[Phase]</strong> — [what happens and what the client sees at the end].</li><li><strong>[Phase]</strong> — [what happens and what the client sees at the end].</li></ol><h2>Deliverables</h2><ul><li>[Deliverable]</li><li>[Deliverable]</li><li>[Deliverable]</li></ul><p><strong>Not included:</strong> [what is out of scope].</p><h2>Timeline</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Milestone</th><th>Date</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Kick-off]</td><td>[Date]</td></tr><tr><td>[Milestone]</td><td>[Date]</td></tr><tr><td>[Delivery]</td><td>[Date]</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Investment</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th style=\"text-align: right;\">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Item]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0.00]</td></tr><tr><td>[Item]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0.00]</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>[0.00]</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Payment terms: [e.g. 50% on signing, 50% on delivery]. This proposal is valid until [date].</p><h2>Why us</h2><p>[Relevant experience, a similar result you delivered, and who will do the work.]</p><h2>Acceptance</h2><p>To go ahead, sign below and return a copy.</p><table class=\"pd-doc-plain\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><br><br>______________________________<br>[Client name, title]<br>Date:</td><td><br><br>______________________________<br>[Your name, title]<br>Date:</td></tr></tbody></table>",
